"After the party Manon Barre lured Hazel Velra by black sedan to her apartment near Nautilus Needle."
"Hazel killed Manon with a blow to the temple from her timeglass, claiming self-defense."
"For nearly fifteen years Manon ran a side business with Aulia Velra at LeafSong's exams."
"Her payment was to be time with the rejuvenating Healer Horatio."
"Afterward Manon's social media showed her away animation, as if she had been summoned."
"Aulia covered it up by sending Hazel off as a long-term Triplanets volunteer."
